/td><td align="center">0.1</td><td align="center">0.1</td><td align="center">0.1</td></tr><tr><td align="center"><bold>STDEV</bold></td><td align="center">0.854</td><td align="center">0.820</td><td align="center">0.726</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p><sup>^</sup>The average size is based on all cases that reported the third block. Cases with <italic>large volume </italic>tumors had many blocks with large sizes of tumor (&#x02265;3 blocks), whereas, <italic>small volume </italic>tumors had fewer blocks with tumor available (&#x0003c; 3 blocks). The total number of the 3<sup>rd </sup>block with the presence of tumor was many from <italic>large volume </italic>tumors, thus the higher average size compared to largest block #1.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></sec></back></article>